Z||000006||mbramble||05-24-2000||10:33 PM||||Did mine this afternoon.  Not sure how long it took because I was changing oil in two other vehicles while the engine was warming up/cooling down.  Flushed it with Xerex (I think!) flush and then ran clean water thru twice.  Used the instructions on the link provided by Gokart above and after going thru the filling procedure once, and checking, it was full.  Put the thermostat back in and all is done.  What a place to put a thermostat!!  Cool.  Never looked at it before but would have been nice if every vehicle I had owned were as easy to replace the thermo.<P>Only problem I had -- I found it necessary to remove he coolant overflow tank so that I could get to the radiator drain c0ck (had to do that so the word won't be censored!!).  Maybe if I had the front end jacked up I could have gotten it from below?? but it seemed easier to remove the tank.  Especially when the procedure calls for the back end to be higher.  Could not see jacking up the fron each time to open close the drain....<p>[This message has been edited by mbramble (edited 05-24-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||ounmongk||05-24-2000||11:02 PM||||done, and done.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I invested in a pair of wheel ramps. does the job nicely for raising either the front or the rear. even got to do my first oil change on this car. ( i mean by myself) what an experience! Is there any trick to taking the oil filter out so that I don't look like a grease monkey afterwards? Also, what would I use to clean all the spillage from the oil filter? WD-40?  Maybe I'll just do a search.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Thanks again, everyone, glad to be a part of this forum!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>  ||||reg||1
Z||000008||RossT||05-25-2000||12:30 AM||||Has anyone tried to open the drain plugs in the coolant tubes? That would  be the lowest point in the system.  Wouldn't that make it easier to get the gunk that settles to the bottom? Or do you risk breaking/bending the coolent tube??||||reg||1
